# text = If you ask me , or if you ask yourself -- which is more likely -- what emboldens me , I answer , I have been strongly assured , that you are a man of rectitude and plain dealing , with the soundest of sound hearts , and that you are blessed in a wife distinguished by the same qualities Your information is true of Mrs Boffin , anyhow When I add , I can discern for myself what the general tongue says of you -- that you are quite unspoiled by Fortune , and not uplifted -- I trust you will not , as a man of an open nature , suspect that I mean to flatter you , but will believe that all I mean is to excuse myself , these being my only excuses for my present intrusion How much
