# text = I couldn't undo what was done ; and when he begs and prays , " Old pardner , on my knees , don't split upon me !" I only makes answer " Never speak another word to Roger Riderhood , nor look him in the face !" and I shuns that man You have been troubled in your mind a long time , man Hages When all that stir was made , when the Government reward was offered , when the police were on the alert , when the whole country rang with the crime Hah Warn't I troubled in my mind then When conjecture ran wild , when the most extravagant suspicions were afloat , when half a dozen innocent people might have been laid by the heels any hour in the day Hah Warn't I troubled in my mind through it all But he hadn't the opportunity then of earning so much money , you see The T'other Governor hits the nail , Lawyer Lightwood !
