# text = I beg to observe that if this missing lime could be got hold of without any young female relative of any distinguished gentleman engaged in the lime trade ( which I cherish next to my life ) being present , I think it might be a more agreeable proceeding to the assisting bystanders , that is to say , lime-burners I also should much prefer that It shall be done , gentlemen , if it can be done conveniently
