# text = That , also , is alone known to myself Don't you know that , if you didn't do the deed , what you say you could tell is worth from five to ten thousand pound I know it very well , and when I claim the money you shall share it I know it as well as I know that you and George Radfoot were one together in more than one dark business ; and as well as I know that you , Roger Riderhood , conspired against an innocent man for blood-money ; and as well as I know that I can -- and that I swear I will !-- give you up on both scores , and be the proof against you in my own person , if you defy me Father Don't defy him !
