# text = But it was not my object or my interest to be traced out Mr Lightwood as chance has brought us face to face at last -- which is not to be wondered at , for the wonder is , that , in spite of all my pains to the contrary , chance has not confronted us together sooner -- I have only to remind you that you have been at my house , and to add that I have not changed my residence Sir ' returned Lightwood , with a meaning glance towards Bella , ' my position is a truly painful one .
