# text = You have had him well under inspection , I hope Suppose you was just to step round to-night then , and give him orders from me -- I say from me , because he knows I won't be played with -- to be ready with his papers , his accounts , and his cash , at that time in the morning And as a matter of form , which will be agreeable to your own feelings , before we go out ( for I'll walk with you part of the way , though my leg gives under me with weariness ), let's have a look at the stock in trade Boffin at home He'll do though it ain't what I call him Now , I tell you what , young fellow I won't have it .
